## Phase 2: Project Scaffolding

### [NEW] Project Root Files

#### [NEW] [package.json](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/pc_doc/realme-buds-desktop/realme-buds-desktop/package.json)

Standard Electron + Vite project with these key dependencies:
- `electron` — desktop shell
- `vite` — build tooling  
- `@anthropic-ai/sdk` — (not needed, placeholder)
- `noble` or `@electron/bluetooth` — BLE communication from Node.js main process

#### [NEW] [vite.config.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/pc_doc/realme-buds-desktop/realme-buds-desktop/vite.config.js)

Vite config for renderer process (HTML/CSS/JS).

---

### [NEW] Main Process (`src/main/`)

#### [NEW] [main.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/pc_doc/realme-buds-desktop/realme-buds-desktop/src/main/main.js)

- Create BrowserWindow with Web Bluetooth permissions
- Register IPC handlers for BLE operations
- System tray setup

#### [NEW] [preload.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/pc_doc/realme-buds-desktop/realme-buds-desktop/src/main/preload.js)

- Expose safe IPC bridge to renderer (`contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld`)

#### [NEW] [ble.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/pc_doc/realme-buds-desktop/realme-buds-desktop/src/main/ble.js)

Core BLE communication module:
- `scanForDevice(name)` — scan for "realme Buds T310"
- `connect(macAddress)` — establish BLE connection
- `discoverServices()` — enumerate GATT services
- `sendCommand(characteristicUUID, bytes)` — write command bytes
- `setANCMode(mode)` — high-level: sends the correct hex payload for `"anc"`, `"transparent"`, or `"normal"`
- `getBatteryLevel()` — reads battery characteristic (standard BLE UUID `0x2A19`)
- `disconnect()` — clean disconnect

---

